@startuml
title Interaction Service - Record Event And Analytics
participant "Source Service" as Source
participant "InteractionEventViewSet" as InteractionAPI
database "Interaction DB" as DB
database "Neo4j Graph" as Graph
actor Analyst

== Record event ==
Source -> InteractionAPI: POST /api/interactions/events
InteractionAPI -> DB: create InteractionEvent
DB --> InteractionAPI: event saved with signal_weight
InteractionAPI -> DB: get_or_create BehaviorProfile, increment event_count
alt event_type == search_performed
  InteractionAPI -> DB: create SearchQueryLog
end
InteractionAPI -> DB: get_or_create EventAggregate, increment metric_value
InteractionAPI -> Graph: sync_interaction_event(event)
Graph --> InteractionAPI: synced
InteractionAPI --> Source: 201 event

== Analytics ==
Analyst -> InteractionAPI: GET /api/interactions/events/data_quality
InteractionAPI -> DB: aggregate event quality metrics
DB --> InteractionAPI: counts
InteractionAPI --> Analyst: analytics result
@enduml

